---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — HarvTech"
  description="HARVTECH LTD privacy policy — how we collect, use, and protect your personal data under UK GDPR."
>
  <section class="container-page py-20">
    <p class="eyebrow mb-4">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="title-display mb-4 hero-gradient leading-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="body-muted text-sm">Last updated: June 2026</p>
  </section>

  <section class="border-border-faintest border-t">
    <div class="container-page py-16">
      <div class="prose-policy max-w-3xl space-y-10">

        <div class="card p-8 space-y-4">
          <h2 class="title-card text-lg">1. Who we are</h2>
          <p class="body-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
            HARVTECH LTD (&ldquo;HarvTech&rdquo;, &ldquo;we&rdquo;, &ldquo;us&rdquo;) is a company registered in England and
            Wales under company number 13134225. Our registered office is at 31 Wellington Street,
            Hertford, England, SG14 3AN.
          </p>
          <p class="body-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
            We are the data controller for the personal data described in this policy. If you have
            any questions or wishes to exercise your rights, contact us at{' '}
            <a href="mailto:alex@harvtech.co.uk" class="text-primary hover:underline">
              alex@harvtech.co.uk
            </a>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card p-8 space-y-4">
          <h2 class="title-card text-lg">2. What data we collect and why</h2>

          <div class="space-y-5">
            <div>
              <p class="text-text-primary text-sm font-semibold mb-1">Enquiry and contact data</p>
              <p class="body-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
                When you email us or contact us via LinkedIn, we process your name, email address,
                organisation name (where provided), and the content of your message.
              </p>
              <p class="body-muted text-sm leading-relaxed mt-2">
                <span class="text-text-hero font-medium">Legal basis:</span> legitimate interests &mdash;
                to respond to your enquiry and assess whether we can help.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="border-border-faintest border-t pt-5">
              <p class="text-text-primary text-sm font-semibold mb-1">Engagement and contract data</p>
              <p class="body-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
                If we enter a contract, we process contact details, project correspondence,
                invoicing information, and any other data necessary to deliver the agreed services.
              </p>
              <p class="body-muted text-sm leading-relaxed mt-2">
                <span class="text-text-hero font-medium">Legal basis:</span> contractual necessity.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="border-border-faintest border-t pt-5">
              <p class="text-text-primary text-sm font-semibold mb-1">Website visits</p>
              <p class="body-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
                This website does not use tracking cookies, third-party analytics, or advertising.
                We do not collect or store any browsing data.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card p-8 space-y-4">
          <h2 class="title-card text-lg">3. How long we keep your data</h2>
          <div class="space-y-3">
            {[
              ['Enquiry data (no contract follows)', '2 years from last contact'],
              ['Contract correspondence and project materials', '7 years from end of engagement (HMRC requirement)'],
              ['Invoices and financial records', '7 years from the relevant financial year end'],
            ].map(([category, retention]) => (
              <div class="flex gap-4 text-sm">
                <span class="text-primary mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-current" aria-hidden="true" />
                <span class="body-muted">
                  <span class="text-text-hero font-medium">{category}:</span> {retention}
                </span>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card p-8 space-y-4">
          <h2 class="title-card text-lg">4. Who we share data with</h2>
          <p class="body-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
            We do not sell, rent, or share your personal data with third parties for marketing
            purposes.
          </p>
          <p class="body-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
            We may share data with our professional advisers (accountants, legal counsel) where
            necessary, and only under appropriate confidentiality obligations. We may also disclose
            data where required to do so by law or by a regulatory authority.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card p-8 space-y-4">
          <h2 class="title-card text-lg">5. Your rights</h2>
          <p class="body-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Under UK GDPR you have the right to:
          </p>
          <div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
            {[
              ['Access', 'Request a copy of the personal data we hold about you.'],
              ['Rectification', 'Ask us to correct inaccurate or incomplete data.'],
              ['Erasure', 'Request deletion of your data in certain circumstances.'],
              ['Objection', 'Object to processing based on legitimate interests.'],
              ['Restriction', 'Ask us to restrict how we use your data while a dispute is resolved.'],
              ['Portability', 'Receive your data in a structured, machine-readable format.'],
            ].map(([right, desc]) => (
              <div class="bg-bg-2 rounded-lg p-4">
                <p class="text-text-primary text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">{right}</p>
                <p class="body-muted text-xs leading-relaxed">{desc}</p>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
          <p class="body-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
            To exercise any right, email{' '}
            <a href="mailto:alex@harvtech.co.uk" class="text-primary hover:underline">
              alex@harvtech.co.uk
            </a>. We will respond within 30 days.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card p-8 space-y-4">
          <h2 class="title-card text-lg">6. Complaints</h2>
          <p class="body-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
            If you are unhappy with how we have handled your personal data, you have the right to
            lodge a complaint with the Information Commissioner&rsquo;s Office (ICO):
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-primary mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-current" />
              <span class="body-muted">Website: <a href="https://ico.org.uk" rel="noopener" target="_blank" class="text-primary hover:underline">ico.org.uk</a></span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-primary mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-current" />
              <span class="body-muted">Telephone: 0303 123 1113</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p class="body-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
            We would appreciate the opportunity to address your concern directly before you contact
            the ICO.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card p-8 space-y-4">
          <h2 class="title-card text-lg">7. Changes to this policy</h2>
          <p class="body-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
            We may update this policy from time to time. The &ldquo;last updated&rdquo; date at the
            top of this page reflects the most recent revision. Continued use of this website
            following any update constitutes acceptance of the revised policy.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
